 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Output",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Y is an open drain. Joining the Y pins of several open-drain parts gives an active-LOW wired-OR, or equally an active-HIGH wired-AND."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Supply and inputs",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The part works from 0.8 V to 3.6 V. The input A accepts up to 3.6 V, and the Ioff feature supports partial power-down operation."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Timing measurement",
   "page": 5,
   "text": "The input swings from 0 V to VI = VCC. Propagation delays tPLH and tPHL are taken between the input and output crossings of VM = VCC/2, at each of the four load capacitances."
  }
 ],
